WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.450
CAF Recruitment Collapse & Weaponized Incompetence.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:15.512
In October 2024, facing a catastrophic recruiting crisis, the Canadian Armed Forces quietly dissolved the Canadian Forces Aptitude Test (CFAT).

00:00:15.512 --> 00:00:30.625
By replacing a mandatory cognitive logic evaluation with a biographical questionnaire, the state has effectively eliminated the IQ floor for the military—intentionally weaponizing individuals who would otherwise have been deemed completely unrecruitable.
